JULink is a social media platform designed by students, for students, at the University of Jordan. It provides features such as posting, interacting, and following other users. The primary aim of JULink is to bridge the communication gap between the university and its students. It is delivered as a web application, accessible on any network and through any web browser. Beyond communication, JULink also serves as a digital space for students to share experiences, stay informed about campus activities, and engage with their peers. In doing so, it encourages a stronger sense of community and makes student life at the University of Jordan more connected and collaborative.

